{"time": 1774164037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375629790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“哎嘿嘿警官先生又见面了”"}
{"time": 1774164151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946685053", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "警官喝了一口咖啡，不置可否，等待你们的下午"}
{"time": 1774164157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142763189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "警官喝了一口咖啡，不置可否，等待你们的下文"}
{"time": 1774164221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952930705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*走向警官“好久不见，警官先生，我们受诺顿先生之托几经波折，目前在参与调查关于儿童失踪的事件，前些日子，我们去了陈思礼拜堂发现有可疑人员活动的痕迹，后来便去了里希特警官的家里了解了一些情况，里希特警官让我们去丹弗斯州立精神病院进行问询，希望你们能帮我们写一封推荐信”递出里希特警官的签名为让"}
{"time": 1774164253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011605962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "为证"}
{"time": 1774164450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165622454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯皱起眉，“调查这些东西吗……”"}
{"time": 1774164581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088652214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "没有过多询问，他掏出口袋里的钢笔为你们写了一封简短的引荐信，并盖上章，随后扬了扬“这些东西只能代表我个人推荐，并不具有官方效力，请自行说服医院放行”"}
{"time": 1774164599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528538859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“好的，感谢您”"}
{"time": 1774164602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050754659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“还有，留下你们的居住地址，以便我们后续跟进调查”"}
{"time": 1774164604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785434688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（这么顺利？）"}
{"time": 1774164637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236765004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（这么顺利？）"}
{"time": 1774164642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884358816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（呵呵）"}
{"time": 1774164676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148797172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（难道等着你们再过没成功过几次的骰子吗（）"}
{"time": 1774164724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224869619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1050754659]说着便向你们出示了钢笔和记录文件"}
{"time": 1774164732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844104301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*写"}
{"time": 1774164749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081364105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "把自己的居住地址写了下去。"}
{"time": 1774164754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117395498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“对了，警官先生，我们这几日还去拜访了失踪儿童家庭，之前几次调查有所惊动可疑的人员，希望你们近期可以多关注失踪孩子的家庭和退休警官先生的周边情况与人身安全”"}
{"time": 1774164770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717368780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“对了，关于十年前那场沉思教堂突袭行动，警局里面有相关资料吗？”"}
{"time": 1774164823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951814593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（喂我线索）"}
{"time": 1774164901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824356808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“前几日，我们在克拉里昂二手书店办公室的柜子里发现了两具头骨，由于当日实在害怕，便直接离开了，未能及时报警，此事关系重大希望你们警方能去探查一二”"}
{"time": 1774164909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094716037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117395498]警官有些不耐“警力有限，我们不可能因为如此久之前的事情和毫无根据的怀疑便动用人手，能允许你们个人团体自行调查已经是我们能做出的最大方便了”"}
{"time": 1774164909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122360578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（给他们找点麻烦）"}
{"time": 1774164926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084408643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1717368780]“你们之前不是早就看过了吗？还要再看一遍？”"}
{"time": 1774165039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835902844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“明白的警官先生，知道你们公务繁忙，只是希望周边日常的巡警能够多注意一下是否有异常的情况”"}
{"time": 1774165057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935926748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*用钢笔在记录文件上签字"}
{"time": 1774165070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893067644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=824356808]“理由相同，除非有明确证据，否则我们不会因为你的怀疑便侵犯公民的私人财产，并且，你是怎么进入他们办公室里查看柜子的？”安德鲁斯严肃地看向你"}
{"time": 1774165120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641817410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“原来上次的就是全部了吗？有点过于单薄了，我还以为警察的工作是很严谨的呢“"}
{"time": 1774165121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394792180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“这几日那里夜晚的骚动果然还是你们干出来的？”"}
{"time": 1774165134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353393372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（还有不打自招（）"}
{"time": 1774165139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211815580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（啊咧"}
{"time": 1774165159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75191567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1774165181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308400448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "”他的办公室又没有拉窗帘，往里面看发现的咯“"}
{"time": 1774165181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772418833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=224869619]（[CQ:at,qq=2037978956] ）"}
