{"time": 1774680286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1452471616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "警官淡淡地看了哈里一眼，“你们四人的照片已经被同步至全州警察局及公路检查点，最好别有多余的想法”"}
{"time": 1774680305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821176671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1628621022]那个人已经离开了"}
{"time": 1774680348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005472987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*问警官“是谁替我们缴纳了保释金？”"}
{"time": 1774680474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643798863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "警官翻了翻记录“呃，玛丽·克莱尔·赖特，一个小女孩。”"}
{"time": 1774680509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604656319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“她有留下什么信息吗？”"}
{"time": 1774680545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65504123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“只是一个小女孩吗？她的监护人呢？”"}
{"time": 1774680652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337774074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“她只说是一个叫这个名字的人委托她来帮忙缴纳保释金，其他的我就不知道了”"}
{"time": 1774680882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842617737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“她往哪走了”"}
{"time": 1774680986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602578555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“？你实在要问的话，大概是这个方向？不过她昨晚就走了，我并不觉得你还能找到她”警官指向了北方"}
{"time": 1774681053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122570715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“没什么事就赶紧走，过好你们自己的日常生活，等我们案件推进会通知你们的。”"}
{"time": 1774681065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927875997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（？她昨晚给的保释金咋今天才放我们出来）"}
{"time": 1774681113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368256753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“请问有关于玛丽·克莱尔·赖特的记录吗，比如说有什么案件里出现过这个名字或者有她的住址信息之类的吗？”"}
{"time": 1774681460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488336763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=368256753]警官抿了抿嘴，叹了口气“不是说了别给自己找麻烦吗？好好回家休息上学上班等我们查案不行吗？况且我们凭什么给你们查阅公民的个人信息”"}
